sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant W as Web app
  participant A as Auth API
  participant D as Database
  U->>W: Sign in
  W->>A: POST /login
  A->>D: Find user
  D-->>A: User record
  alt valid password
    A-->>W: Session token
    W-->>U: Dashboard
  else invalid password
    A--xW: 401
    W-->>U: Show error
  end
  Note over W,A: Tokens expire after one hour
  loop every 5 minutes
    W->>W: Refresh session
  end
